When the user describes a feature, bug, tweak, problem, idea, or other work to deliver,
prefer the model-invoked **workflows** skill: infer which pipeline fits, then
read and run only that skill. Do not freestyle past a supported workflow.

On Cursor, sub-agent / Task `model` values are catalog-closed: only
`composer-2.5` / `composer-2.5-fast` (Routine/Moderate) or
`cursor-grok-4.5-high` / `cursor-grok-4.5-high-fast` (Demanding/manager).
Third-party models bill the API budget. Load CONCEPT_DELEGATION and
`concepts/platforms/cursor.md` before spawning workers.

